{"2174430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Welcome to Lightford", "steam_appid": 2174430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/a605b14b49993dc02e2d9a6662098a35.webp?t=1787270314\" width=813 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the Pacific Northwest town of Lightford in the 90s and uncover a conspiracy, gather clues and draw your own conclusions. Different parties are responsible for this once so peaceful place spiraling into corrupt and supernatural chaos. Cameras, Scanners, and a mobile detective board workstation. Use all the tools you have been given to untangle this mess and most importantly <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/9d1020fced02711ac436e87f21f83383.poster.avif?t=1787270314\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/9d1020fced02711ac436e87f21f83383.webm?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/9d1020fced02711ac436e87f21f83383.mp4?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/718a491cb21835f1295babbc925c1132.webp?t=1787270314\" width=813 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasers, grappling hooks, teleportation devices and more are at your disposal. Combine them however you can imagine and solve every puzzle your own way. Combat rewards improvisation and creative thinking over raw strength, so think fast, not hard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/599b9073f7ba43d94eb2c460ad7855c8.poster.avif?t=1787270314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/599b9073f7ba43d94eb2c460ad7855c8.webm?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/599b9073f7ba43d94eb2c460ad7855c8.mp4?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/e49dc2f508e92c05f162c502cb0c1b3f.webp?t=1787270314\" width=813 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Lightford in two timelines: the living town of 1990 and its ruined future of 1995. What you change in one era echoes in the other. Places, people and paths that are closed in one timeline might be wide open in the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/80e04f7bf9e50aabbaa91cb1437ed511.poster.avif?t=1787270314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/80e04f7bf9e50aabbaa91cb1437ed511.webm?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/80e04f7bf9e50aabbaa91cb1437ed511.mp4?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/803fec39a6de6f3b33116efcb9f120ee.webp?t=1787270314\" width=813 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this lively town first hand and chat with its citizens. Take on quests that lead you to places you shouldn't be. Stray from the beaten path and you might find something useful, or something you'll wish you hadn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/b63adf8108088f228947958215f9a7b8.poster.avif?t=1787270314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/b63adf8108088f228947958215f9a7b8.webm?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/b63adf8108088f228947958215f9a7b8.mp4?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/a605b14b49993dc02e2d9a6662098a35.webp?t=1787270314\" width=813 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the Pacific Northwest town of Lightford in the 90s and uncover a conspiracy, gather clues and draw your own conclusions. Different parties are responsible for this once so peaceful place spiraling into corrupt and supernatural chaos. Cameras, Scanners, and a mobile detective board workstation. Use all the tools you have been given to untangle this mess and most importantly <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo