270314\" width=813 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Lightford in two timelines: the living town of 1990 and its ruined future of 1995. What you change in one era echoes in the other. Places, people and paths that are closed in one timeline might be wide open in the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/80e04f7bf9e50aabbaa91cb1437ed511.poster.avif?t=1787270314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/80e04f7bf9e50aabbaa91cb1437ed511.webm?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/80e04f7bf9e50aabbaa91cb1437ed511.mp4?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/803fec39a6de6f3b33116efcb9f120ee.webp?t=1787270314\" width=813 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience this lively town first hand and chat with its citizens. Take on quests that lead you to places you shouldn't be. Stray from the beaten path and you might find something useful, or something you'll wish you hadn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/b63adf8108088f228947958215f9a7b8.poster.avif?t=1787270314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/b63adf8108088f228947958215f9a7b8.webm?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/extras/b63adf8108088f228947958215f9a7b8.mp4?t=1787270314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Investigate a supernatural conspiracy in a 90s town hiding something far worse than secrets. Travel between 1990 and its ruined 1995 future, photograph anomalies, decode entities, and survive a town that doesn't want you here. Think outside the box. Every problem has more than one solution.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/3914cbaed38857a42718fce9334dc2c7873671e9/header.jpg?t=1787270314", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/69abf25fb303339d137743161942dc450090c342/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787270314", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174430/69abf25fb303339d137743161942dc450090c342/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787270314", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 560 with 4 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended. Target: 1080p, medium settings, 30 FPS.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 Super